  "rulesText": "Level 1 Abjuration (Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Reaction, which you take when you are hit by an attack roll or targeted by the Magic Missile spell\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: 1 round\n\nAn imperceptible barrier of magical force protects you. Until the start of your next turn, you have a +5\n\nbonus to AC, including against the triggering attack, and you take no damage from Magic Missile.",
